		"description": {
			"value": "<p><em>You breathe draconic power into the air. As it settles, you or your target's breath takes on magical qualities as you draw on draconic power.</em></p><p>The target can use an action to exhale energy.</p><p><strong>Action</strong> - 15 ft Cone (Self)</p><p><strong>[[/save dex]]{Dexterity Save}</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Failure:</strong> A target takes [[/damage]] damage.*</p></li><li><p><strong>Success:</strong> Half damage.</p></li></ul><p><strong>*Upcasting:</strong> Increase damage by [[/damage 1d6]] for each spell slot level above 2nd.</p>",
